6","paper_id":"DOI:10.1016_j.xcrp.2025.102548","quote":"The assembly of coin cells for the BO was done under a nitro- gen atmosphere (<5 ppm O₂) using an automated robotic setup, ODACell 2, which incorporated cycling.","source_sha256":"203963977eb9f3bc14773e41cc47f5bbfe57e09c3676b99e62f81e19c24856be"},{"char_end":1088,"char_start":936,"chunk_id":"mdchk_6dddd26eea2a59a1","document_char_end":28650,"document_char_start":28498,"evidence_id":"ev_bedfc0ca28c558f4","paper_id":"DOI:10.1016_j.xcrp.2025.102548","quote":"Eight stock solutions were prepared, each with 1.0 mol kg 1 (molal, m) salt in sol- vent—salts: LiClO₄ and LiTFSI and solvents: DMSO, TMP, ACN, and H₂O.","source_sha256":"203963977eb9f3bc14773e41cc47f5bbfe57e09c3676b99e62f81e19c24856be"},{"char_end":1087,"char_start":1054,"chunk_id":"mdchk_6dddd26eea2a59a1","document_char_end":28649,"document_char_start":28616,"evidence_id":"ev_043d174314aec93b","paper_id":"DOI:10.1016_j.xcrp.2025.102548","quote":"solvents: DMSO, TMP, ACN, and H₂O","source_sha256":"203963977eb9f3bc14773e41cc47f5bbfe57e09c3676b99e62f81e19c24856be"},{"char_end":1199,"char_start":1089,"chunk_id":"mdchk_6dddd26eea2a59a1","document_char_end":28761,"document_char_start":28651,"evidence_id":"ev_b9fabde49b67567d","paper_id":"DOI:10.1016_j.xcrp.2025.102548","quote":"Electrolyte formulations from the BO were pre- pared by automated pipette mixing of the eight stock solutions.","source_sha256":"203963977eb9f3bc14773e41cc47f5bbfe57e09c3676b99e62f81e19c24856be"},{"char_end":113,"char_start":17,"chunk_id":"mdchk_8b16d228af0397cb","document_char_end":32133,"document_char_start":32037,"evidence_id":"ev_be2a0d9a1d7e727a","paper_id":"DOI:10.1016_j.xcrp.2025.102548","quote":"Neware BTS 4008Tn-5V10mA battery testers were used to cycle the coin cells assembled for the BO.","source_sha256":"15605ee3db332e7cc4c9b6e9a05785c484bde0ca5d17a6ca875a9937e691751d"},{"char_end":232,"char_start":114,"chunk_id":"mdchk_8b16d228af0397cb","document_char_end":32252,"document_char_